+## G. michael-gate — the public front door
+
+A second Railway service (`gate/Dockerfile`, `src/michael/gate/`) with its
+own auth, rate limiting, session cookies and sign-in UI. It was built and
+deployed without a worker owning it or a criterion here covering it (see
+`.orca/TEAM.md`, "Unowned"). WORKER-4 owns it from round 2 onward. It was
+**not** changed or attacked to produce this section — everything below is
+read from `docs/gate-cutover.md` and prior read-only checks. The next round
+should audit it properly, including things this list does not yet cover
+(session fixation, cookie-theft blast radius, the admin console's own input
+handling, rate-limit bypass beyond the client_address check below).
